%% title: Management group tree and policy inheritance
%% alt: The lab's root group, lab-az104-03-mgmt-groups-root, sits under the tenant root group with prod and dev groups below it. The audit-environment-tag assignment is made at the lab's root group and prod and dev inherit it; your subscription stays under the tenant root group, outside the lab's tree, so the policy never reaches it.
flowchart TB
  tr("Tenant root group")
  sub("your subscription<br/>stays where it is")
  root{{"lab-az104-03-mgmt-groups-root<br/>assignment audit-environment-tag<br/>audit only: no environment tag"}}
  prod("lab-az104-03-mgmt-groups-prod")
  dev("lab-az104-03-mgmt-groups-dev")
  tr --> sub
  tr --> root
  root -- "inherits the policy" --> prod
  root -- "inherits the policy" --> dev
